{"steam_appid":2836740,"steam_name":"Olga - Episode 1","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2836740/770588984/5b7e9454cf799a700d06e428593838030ee436a2/1792152448/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1792153385","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257313616/44230a888de79a04f4f88cf68da254ac1b10ed50/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1792153385","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836740/9811227a0a0c18d6a6fcf630aa1044d74286e6a3/ss_9811227a0a0c18d6a6fcf630aa1044d74286e6a3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1792153386","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836740/7ed7df9643757680e94388f0c9012c619924074a/ss_7ed7df9643757680e94388f0c9012c619924074a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1792153386","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836740/dced5ff69149aef78b75a943ff13a3733f20d7ae/ss_dced5ff69149aef78b75a943ff13a3733f20d7ae.1920x1080.jpg?t=1792153386","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836740/e6f0545d44e4808b9337d95c2bfe7275558f36b1/ss_e6f0545d44e4808b9337d95c2bfe7275558f36b1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1792153386","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836740/e9cb8f47057c373344748ed13f6ee2377ae39411/ss_e9cb8f47057c373344748ed13f6ee2377ae39411.1920x1080.jpg?t=1792153386"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Olga is a short, episodic first-person narrative walking simulator game, where each new episode reveals the next piece of the story.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836740/extras/8df73efa1b71812d4891e5f1dd2432bf.poster.avif?t=1792153386\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836740/extras/8df73efa1b71812d4891e5f1dd2432bf.webm?t=1792153386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836740/extras/8df73efa1b71812d4891e5f1dd2432bf.mp4?t=1792153386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After coming across what’s seemingly the biggest career opportunity of their lives, Olga’s parents leave the country for a few months, leaving her at her grandparents’ home in Belovodica, a hidden, isolated village deep within the mountains. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836740/extras/9b46893d3a1375fa2b4ebea5a7964f82.poster.avif?t=1792153386\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836740/extras/9b46893d3a1375fa2b4ebea5a7964f82.webm?t=1792153386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836740/extras/9b46893d3a1375fa2b4ebea5a7964f82.mp4?t=1792153386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story unfolds at a time when communication devices, such as cell phones, were not available to those living in such areas.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All Belovodica has to offer Olga is an isolated, peaceful, and quiet life with her old grandparents, or at least that’s what she wanted to believe… </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836740/extras/8eba598f29701d08ef8f2724c727dcd4.poster.avif?t=1792153386\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836740/extras/8eba598f29701d08ef8f2724c727dcd4.webm?t=1792153386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836740/extras/8eba598f29701d08ef8f2724c727dcd4.mp4?t=1792153386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What to expect</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow-paced, there’s no need to rush </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Combat Systems </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linear </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy and Short </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by Slavic Tradition and Architecture </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pleasant and easy-going, Not Demanding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple Animations and Interactions</p></li></ul>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 / AMD Ryzen 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 950 / AMD Radeon RX 470<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 / AMD Ryzen 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 / AMD Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Adventure","Casual","Indie"],"developers":["Workbench Entertainment"],"publishers":["Workbench Entertainment"],"release_date":"Sep 9, 2026"}